<item>
            <title>[LU-20880] sanity-quota test_6: ll_ost00 service thread was inactive for 43.809 seconds</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20880</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-quota test_6 on review-dne-zfs-part-4 (RHEL 10.1 client,&lt;br/&gt;
ZFS servers) failed with:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;16896.621747&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Lustre: ll_ost00_025: service thread pid 203352 was&lt;br/&gt;
inactive for 43.809 seconds. The thread might be hung, or it might&lt;br/&gt;
only be slow and will resume later.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is the long-standing &quot;OST service thread briefly over the&lt;br/&gt;
40s inactivity threshold during test_6&apos;s dd writes&quot; pattern already&lt;br/&gt;
seen (and closed Duplicate / Cannot Reproduce) in &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-3371&quot; title=&quot;sanity-quota test_6: @@@@@@ FAIL: LNet: Service thread pid 9320 was inactive for 40.00s.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-3371&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-3371&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12749&quot; title=&quot;sanity-quota test_6: FAIL: [22292.915881] Lustre: ll_ost_io00_002: service thread pid 4147 was inactive for 40.154 seconds.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-12749&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-12749&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
and &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18255&quot; title=&quot;sanity-quota test_6: ll_ost_ioXXX: service thread pid 141307 was inactive&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-18255&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18255&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, now recurring with no open ticket to link it to.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Change 67822 PS6 does not touch quota, OST I/O service threads or&lt;br/&gt;
sanity-quota.sh; it only adds a target-recovery test (conf-sanity&lt;br/&gt;
139) and a CFS_FAIL_CHECK() in tgt_init(). Maloo test-history shows&lt;br/&gt;
this is the only sanity-quota test_6 failure among the last 30&lt;br/&gt;
lustre-reviews sessions that ran the suite, consistent with an&lt;br/&gt;
intermittent environment/timing flake rather than anything this&lt;br/&gt;
patch changed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Session: 7d163be2-6bd0-4579-b2a8-e37d9d5660c0&lt;br/&gt;
Test set: 766ddf4b-ad68-49d5-af05-d5ae5c4509f9&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-67822-ps6-18d883479437 on &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/67822&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/67822&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
